# mobile_update on its own, with area_update, for 50 mobile pulses (800 pulses), with Decimus (10) in the temple
# square (3005), Purser (10) at the market square (3014) and Smokegod (60) at the temple (3001), so only Midgaard
# isn't empty: the mobs elsewhere do nothing.
# - mobs wander in and out, by exits that are open and lead where they may go; sentinels stay
# - specials run each pulse (the cityguards, the janitor, the fido, Hassan, the mayor asleep), and a special that
#   acts takes the mob's turn
# - shopkeepers short of their wealth get some gold and silver
# - scavengers pick up the best thing they can carry: a sword and a pie left in the square
# - a charmed mob stays put
@updates area,mobile
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
holylight
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
south
